OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FEarly morning showers easing to
OL,6,Fleave a largely fine and dry day,
OL,7,Falthough some cloud will build through
OL,8,Fthe afternoon from the north. The
OL,9,Fmoderate winds will gradually ease
OL,10,Fbecoming light.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA cloudy evening to start
OL,13,Fbefore cloud breaking and clearing to
OL,14,Fgive clear skies for most of the
OL,15,Fregion by the morning. Winds light and
OL,16,Fvariable, breezy along the coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
