OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FClear skies at first, before
OL,6,Fcloud thickens from the north later,
OL,7,Fwith some patchy light rain moving
OL,8,Fsouthwards overnight. Feeling very
OL,9,Fwarm.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FCloudy
OL,12,Fwith outbreaks of rain on Sunday, dry
OL,13,Fwith sunny spells on Monday and
OL,14,Fthrough Tuesday. Temperatures above
OL,15,Faverage for the time of year.
